$MDESC::Type = "{Flip} 2002";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Football" @
         "\n<f1>Made By: <f0> {Flip}" @
	 
	 "\n<f1>Ball-Tag Rules!" @
	
	 "\n<f0>Ball Tag is like regular TAG, but tribes style! The person with the ball is \"IT\". He/she goes around looking for other players and try to throw the ball at them. If a person catches the ball no matter how it happened, he/she is the next person it. There is a safety zone with light poles in it. Everyone else can go inside this room except for the player who has the ball. Players inside the room can't be tagged no matter what.";
       
